			<div class="content" id="post-content-1361885">
									

<p>The inspiration for this? I'm guessing David Brin's &quot;Lungfish&quot;, a story about the remnants of several alien-built von Neumann probes that have gathered together around a base somewhere in the outer Solar system - a base which is being explored by a human ship (with one biological crew member, and one AI, which apparently strikes the probes as a unique solution to the crisis of the Makers; usually, either the AIs are slaves or they destroy their masters, but the humans have begun &quot;raising&quot; AIs to develop into independent sapience).</p>
<p>In the end, each of the probes is preparing to battle the others to carry out its own programming, to either welcome the newcomers, attack them, or warn them about the dangers among the stars&#8230;</p>

